-### Axis-Aligned Capsule SDF
-A specialized version where the capsule is aligned with a coordinate axis (e.g., Y-axis) [S1, unofficial]. It sets itself apart from the general form by simplifying the projection step to a single coordinate clamp [S1, unofficial]. Choose it when rendering static, axis-aligned tubes [G]. See [Axis-Aligned Capsule SDF](link).
